  "modelKind": "candidate",
  "title": "Q2 stability phase M2M3_B20: RF + partial correlation bootstrap (B=20) + frequency consolidation",
  "assumptions": [
    "M2/M3/AGG bootstrap uses B=20 only (protocol allows <=30 for slow methods); their seat-frequency Monte Carlo error at p=0.8 is about +/-0.09, so their stability evidence is explicitly weaker than M1/M4 B=300",
    "M1 uses fixed per-dim alpha from the full-data 5-fold inner CV (same as phase M1M4) so the 20 reps of M1 align exactly with the first 20 reps of phase M1M4",
    "M3 = Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage joint precision partial correlation (GraphicalLassoCV degenerates to 99.94% exact zeros, recorded in m3_diagnostics.json)",
    "Borda order uses mean rank over M1..M4; ties broken by M4 rank then column index",
    "All conclusions are cross-sectional associations, not causal effects"
  ],
  "equations": [
    "rep b: idx_b = rng_b.integers(0,250,250), rng_b = default_rng(42+(b-1))",
    "M2_b: OOB permutation importance, 200 trees, 3 repeats",
    "M3_b: partial corr = -Theta_jk/sqrt(Theta_jj Theta_kk), Theta = Ledoit-Wolf joint precision",
    "AGG_b = mean rank over M1..M4; Top-3 per dim",
    "seat frequency f(dim,compound,method) = #reps with compound in Top-3 / B; stable iff f>=0.80"
  ],
  "algorithm": "Bootstrap stability phase M2M3 + consolidation. For reps 1..20 (protocol allows <=30 for slow methods): same seeded resamples as phase M1M4; M1 = fixed-alpha Ridge (for Borda aggregation), M2 = RandomForest (200 trees, max_features=0.33) fit on resample with OOB permutation importance (3 repeats, 10% of rows held OOB ~158 rows) -> ranks -> Top-3, M3 = Ledoit-Wolf joint precision partial correlation -> Top-3, M4 = Spearman -> Top-3, AGG = Borda (sum of 4 method ranks) -> Top-3. Writes bootstrap_top3_secondary.csv (rep,dim,rank,compound,method incl AGG), then merges with bootstrap_top3.csv (B=300 M1/M4) to write selection_frequency.csv (per method per dim per compound), stability_by_dimension.csv, stability_seats.csv (frequency of the consensus Top-3 seats from EXP-0041) and stability_summary.json. Emits top3_stability (= mean AGG bootstrap frequency of the 150 consensus seats), freq_ge_080_share, n_top3_slots_stable, jaccard_mean and prior_rank_corr_mean (read from EXP-0041 summary for ROB-0002 consistency), plus r2/r2_overall placeholders documented in params.metricNote.",
